
Task: Open and Verify a New Window

Steps:
1. Open Selenium's example page at https://www.selenium.dev/selenium/web/window_switching_tests/page_with_frame.html.
2. Click "Open new window" and wait until a second window exists.
3. Switch to the new window using its handle.
4. Assert that its title is "Simple Page".
5. Close the new window, switch back, and verify that one window remains.
